{"title":"Career Roadmap · Vehicle Interior Designer","role":"Vehicle Interior Designer","summary":"A Vehicle Interior Designer designs the interior experience of cars, commercial vehicles, EVs, buses, motorcycles and emerging mobility products. The role combines industrial design, ergonomics, materials, digital modelling, user experience and automotive design.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Transportation / Automobile Design","Automotive Design Projects","Interior Design Internship","Junior Automotive Interior Designer","Automotive Interior Designer","Senior Designer","Interior Design Lead"]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Vehicle Interior Designer Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Vehicle interior designers work on the visual, functional and experiential aspects of a vehicle's cabin."},{"type":"h","text":"Core responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design dashboards and instrument panels"},{"text":"Design seats and seating environments"},{"text":"Develop door-panel concepts"},{"text":"Design center consoles"},{"text":"Develop storage and utility areas"},{"text":"Design steering-wheel concepts"},{"text":"Plan displays and HMI layouts"},{"text":"Select interior materials and finishes"},{"text":"Study ergonomics and passenger comfort"},{"text":"Develop design themes"},{"text":"Create sketches and digital concepts"},{"text":"Build 3D models"},{"text":"Prepare design proposals for engineering teams"},{"text":"Work with CMF teams"},{"text":"Collaborate with automotive engineers and manufacturers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The designer focuses primarily on what the interior should look and feel like and how people interact with it, while engineering teams determine how it can be manufactured safely and economically."}]},{"heading":"Why Transportation / Automobile Design Fits","kind":"other","blocks":[